    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d644-a1">

                <pb facs="0551" n="435" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg435"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The President of the Chinese Colony to the American
                        Chargé d’Affaires</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>[<hi rendition="#small-caps">Seal of the Chinese Colony.</hi>] <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Guayaquil</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-03-12">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 12, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the
                    receipt of your communication of March 2, 1912, relative to the Chinese losses
                    sustained during the recent revolution in Ecuador.</p>
                <p>In reply I have the honor to state that I have witnesses in each particular
                    instance as to who caused the damage and as to the extent of the damage. In view
                    of the changes of the Government within the last few days and the impossibility
                    of carrying the case through the Courts within any reasonable length of time, it
                    is respectfully suggested that through the good offices of the United States, a
                    commission be appointed to determine the amount of loss and to fix the
                    responsibility.</p>
                <p>I wish you would consider this method and if you consider it feasible I would be
                    glad to have you take the necessary steps to carry it through. I beg to remain
                    [etc.],</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">C. Santón Tay Sing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
